#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The status of the delivery order on Shopee:\n"
"- Ready to Ship: Seller can arrange shipment.\n"
"- Shipment Arranged: Seller has arranged shipment online and got tracking "
"number from 3PL.\n"
"- Shipped: The parcel has been dropped at 3PL or picked up by 3PL.\n"
"- Cancelled: The order has been cancelled.\n"
"- Pickup Failed: 3PL parcel pickup failed. Need to rearrange shipment."
msgstr ""
"Status dostavnega naročila na Shopeeju:\n"
"- Pripravljeno za odpremo: Prodajalec lahko organizira odpremo.\n"
"- Odpremа urejena: Prodajalec je odpremo uredil prek spleta in od 3PL prejel "
"številko za sledenje.\n"
"- Odpremljeno: Paket je bil oddan ponudniku 3PL ali ga je prevzel ponudnik "
"3PL.\n"
"- Preklicano: Naročilo je bilo preklicano.\n"
"- Prevzem ni uspel: Prevzem paketa pri 3PL ni uspel. Odpremo je treba "
"ponovno urediti."

#. module: sale_shopee
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_shopee.field_stock_picking__shopee_label_status
#, fuzzy
