"- Processing: The shipping label is being processed.\n"
"- Ready: The shipping label is ready to be downloaded.\n"
"- Stored: The shipping label has been downloaded and stored.\n"
"- Failed: The shipping label creation failed."
msgstr ""
"Stanje odpremne nalepke:\n"
"- Ni na voljo: Odpremna nalepka še ni na voljo.\n"
"- V obdelavi: Odpremna nalepka se obdeluje.\n"
"- Pripravljena: Odpremna nalepka je pripravljena za prenos.\n"
"- Shranjena: Odpremna nalepka je bila prenesena in shranjena.\n"
"- Neuspešno: Ustvarjanje odpremne nalepke ni uspelo."

